# Optional: real LinkedIn Voyager response for local mapper testing
#
# 1. Fetch a profile with valid cookies (or copy response from DevTools Network tab)
# 2. Save the JSON body as profile_live.json in this folder
# 3. Set LIVE_PROFILE_SLUG to the profile's public identifier
# 4. Run: go test ./internal/linkedin/ -run LiveFixture -v
#
# profile_live.json is gitignored — never commit real session data or PII.
